      <div class="timeline-item reveal" data-reveal><div class="timeline-dot">2</div><div><h3>A 4-week trial scope</h3><p class="muted">One channel, clearly defined, before anything longer. You see exactly how we work and what it costs.</p></div></div>
      <div class="timeline-item reveal" data-reveal><div class="timeline-dot">3</div><div><h3>A plain-language report</h3><p class="muted">Real numbers against what we said we'd move: a short written report plus a five-minute recorded walkthrough.</p></div></div>
      <div class="timeline-item reveal" data-reveal><div class="timeline-dot">4</div><div><h3>You decide, not us</h3><p class="muted">Continue month-to-month, change scope, or walk away with everything we built. No renewal call, no retention script.</p></div></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
